  "overview": "Monzo Tone of Voice — Hot coral banking cards, MonzoSans typography on deep navy and mint-grey surfaces",
  "dos": "- **Surface & Theme Polarity**: Crisp light (#fff) canvas paired with `#f2f8f3` component surfaces and `#0b0b0c` primary ink.\n- **Brand & Interactive Accent**: Primary actions and focus states anchor on `#ff4f40` with `#0b0b0c` label contrast.\n- **Typographic Voice**: Headings and UI controls set in `MonzoSansDisplay` across 18 type steps.\n- **Component Geometry**: Buttons (`16px`), cards (`16px`), inputs, badges, and navigation bars share consistent spacing and border contrast."
}
